Remarks: The isotherms are given in graphical form only.
The composition of the eutonic point in the NH_4H_2PO_4-(C_4H_9)_2NH_2Cl-H_2O system is:
12.6 mass % NH_4H_2PO_4 (1.62 mol/kg H_2O--compiler);
